1	line	Player	Hello there, I found this tankard in an ogre tomb cavern. It has the emblem of this Inn on it and I wondered if you knew anything about it?
1	line	Bartender	Oh yes, this is Brentle's mug...I'm surprised he left it just lying around down some cave. He's quite protective of it.
1	line	Player	Brentle you say? So you knew him then?
1	line	Bartender	Yeah, this belongs to 'Brentle Vahn', he's quite a common customer, though I've not seen him in a while.
1	line	Bartender	He was talking to some shifty looking wizard the other day. I don't know his name, but I'd recognise him if I saw him.
1	line	Player	Hmm, I'm sorry to tell you this, but Brentle Vahn is dead - I believe he was murdered.
1	line	Bartender	Noooo! I'm shocked...
1	line	Bartender	...but not surprised. He was a good customer...but I knew he would sell his sword arm and do many a dark deed if paid enough.
1	line	Bartender	If you need help bringing the culprit to justice, you let me know.
1	action	end
