1	cond	If the player has the Black prism but not the Torn page:
2	line	Player	There's some undead ogre activity over at 'Jiggig', and the ogres have asked me to look into it. I think I've found a clue and I wonder if you could take a look at it for me?
2	box	You show the black prism to the aged wizard.
2	line	Zavistic Rarve	Hmmm, well this is an uncommon spell component. On its own it's useless, but with certain necromantic spells it can be very powerful. Did you find anything else there?
2	cond	If the player has the Dragon inn tankard:
3	box	You show the tankard to Zavistic.
3	line	Player	Well, I found this...
3	line	Zavistic Rarve	Hmmm, no, that's not really associated with this to be honest. Did you find anything else there?
2	line	Player	Not really.
2	line	Zavistic Rarve	I don't know what to say then, there isn't enough to go on with the clues you've shown me so far. I'd suggest going back to search a bit more, but you may just be wasting your time?
2	line	Zavistic Rarve	Hmm, but this prism does seem to have some magical protection. Once you've finished with this item, bring it back to me would you? I may have a reward for you!
2	line	Player	Sure...I mean, I'll try if I remember.
2	action	end
