0	section	Talking to Sithik Ints
1	line	Sithik Ints	Hey...who gave you permission to come in here!
1	line	Player	Zavistic Rarve said that I could come and talk to you and ask you a few questions.
1	line	Sithik Ints	Oh, Zavistic...why...why would he send you to me?
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Do you know anything about the undead ogres at Jiggig?
2	line	Player	Do you know anything about the undead ogres at Jiggig?
2	line	Sithik Ints	Er...undead ogres...no, sorry, no idea what you're talking about there.
2	line	Player	Hmm, is that right...
2	line	Sithik Ints	Well, yes, yes it is. If I knew something, I'd tell you.
2	line	Sithik Ints	Anyway, dead ogres you say? How strange? That must be a strange sight?
2	line	Player	Very well, if you don't know anything about it, you won't mind if I look around then?
2	action	Continues below from "Well,err....well, actually yes I do mind...it's my place and I don't want strangers going through my things."
1	option	What do you do?
2	line	Player	What do you do?
2	line	Sithik Ints	I'm a scholarly student of the magical arts. When I was younger I used to be an adventurer, probably just like yourself. But I lost interest in the constant fighting, looting and gaining abilities.
2	line	Sithik Ints	Instead I decided to focus my attention and time to study the purer form of the lost arts.
2	line	Player	The lost arts? What are they?
2	line	Sithik Ints	Ignorant people call them the 'dark arts'. I'm talking about Necromancy, the power to bring the dead back to life - the power of the gods! Surely the most awesome power known to man.
2	line	Player	Hmm, well I guess I must be an ignorant person then, because bringing the dead back to life sounds very unnatural.
2	action	previous
1	option	Do you mind if I look around?
2	cond	If asking for the first time:
3	line	Player	Do you mind if I look around?
3	line	Sithik Ints	Well, err....well, actually yes I do mind...it's my place and I don't want strangers going through my things.
3	line	Player	Well, I'm going to have a look around anyway, if you're not involved in this whole thing, you won't have anything to hide.
3	line	Sithik Ints	Why, if I was a few years younger I'd give you a good hiding!
3	line	Player	I'm sure!
3	action	previous
2	cond	If asking him again:
3	line	Player	Do you mind if I look around?
3	line	Sithik Ints	I've already told you that I do! But you'll probably just ignore me again!
3	line	Player	Quite right!
3	action	end
1	option	Ok, thanks.
2	line	Player	Ok, thanks.
2	action	end
