0	section	Using the good portrait on the Dragon Inn Bartender
1	box	You show the portrait to the Inn keeper.
1	line	Bartender	Yeah, that's the guy who was talking to Brentle Vahn the other day! Look at those eyes, never a more shifty looking pair will you ever see!
1	line	Player	Hmm, you've just identified the man who I think sent Brentle Vahn to his death.
1	line	Player	I'm trying to bring him to justice with the Wizards' Guild grand secretary. Do you think you could sign this portrait to say that he was talking to Brentle Vahn.
1	line	Bartender	I can and I will!
1	box	The Dragon Inn bartender signs the portrait.
1	line	Player	Many thanks for your help, it's really very good of you.
1	line	Bartender	Not at all, just doing my part.
0	section	Look-at Signed portrait
