1	action	end
0	section	Using the Signed portrait on Sithik Ints
1	line	Player	Hey, what do you think of this? I'm going to show it to Zavistic and you're going to be in trouble!
1	box	You show the portrait to Sithik.
1	line	Sithik Ints	Hmmm, well, I've got quite a common looking face, I'm often mistaken for other wizards, you know, when I'm wearing my wizard's hat, robes and staff. There's a lot of us around here you know.
1	line	Player	I don't think so! This is a signed picture of you, someone recognised you, you're in deep trouble!
1	line	Sithik Ints	Ok, I'll pay you to keep this secret - how much do you want for the picture?
1	line	Player	You can't buy me Sithik!
1	line	Sithik Ints	Ok, let's say two million...two million to keep quiet and give me the picture.
1	box	Sithik shows you a chest brimming over with coins...
1	line	Player	Oh...erm...well, that is a lot of money actually...er....
1	line	Sithik Ints	Yes, and you deserve it, you're very clever! Now, take the money...
1	select	Be bribed by Sithik for 2 million?
1	option	No, I won't take the money, I'm going to bring you to justice!
2	line	Player	No, I won't take the money, I'm going to bring you to justice!
2	line	Sithik Ints	Oh well, suit yourself! I wasn't going to give you the money anyway! No one will believe some crazy adventurer and an Inn keep.
2	action	end
1	option	Ok, I'll shut up for two million!
2	line	Player	Ok, I'll shut up for two million!
2	line	Sithik Ints	Ha! Ha! You believed me! I'm not going to give you all my money! No one will believe a crazy adventurer and a local Inn keep!
2	line	Player	You're a mean and cruel man Sithik, a mean and cruel man!
2	action	end
0	section	Talking to Zavistic Rarve after gathering evidence
