1	option	I'm here about the sicks...err Zogres
2	select	Select an Option
2	option	What did you say I should do?
3	line	Player	What did you say I should do?
3	line	Zavistic Rarve	You should go and have a chat with Sithik Ints, he's in that house just to the north. He's a lodger and has a room upstairs. Just tell him that I sent you to see him. He should be fine once you've mentioned my name.
3	action	previous
2	option	Where is Sithik?
3	line	Player	Where is Sithik?
3	line	Zavistic Rarve	He's in that house just to the north, less than a few seconds walk away. He's a lodger and has a room upstairs...he's not very well though.
