3	line	Player	I have some items that I'd like you to look at.
3	cond	If the player has the necromancy book:
4	box	You show the Necromancy book to Zavistic.
4	line	Player	I have this necromancy book as evidence that Sithik is involved with the undead ogres at Jiggig.
4	cond	If the player has shown Zavistic the necromancy book before:
5	line	Zavistic Rarve	Yeah, you've shown me this before...if this is all the evidence you have?
5	line	Player	Please just look at it again...
5	line	Zavistic Rarve	Ok, let me look then.
4	line	Zavistic Rarve	Ok, so he's researching necromancy...it doesn't mean anything in itself.
4	line	Player	Yes, but if you look, you can see that there is a half torn page which matches the page I found at Jiggig.
4	line	Zavistic Rarve	Hmm, yes, but someone could have stolen that from him and then gone and cast it without his permission or to try and deliberately implicate him.
# Authored fix (not Wiki): a separator so each piece of evidence is its own branch.
3	action	-
3	cond	If the player has the Book of 'H.A.M':
4	box	You show the HAM book to Zavistic.
4	line	Player	Look, this book proves that Sithik hates all monsters and most likely Ogres with a passion.
4	cond	If the player has shown Zavistic the Book of 'H.A.M' before:
5	line	Zavistic Rarve	Yeah, you've shown me this before...if this is all the evidence you have?
5	line	Player	Please just look at it again...
5	line	Zavistic Rarve	Ok, let me look then.
4	line	Zavistic Rarve	So what, hating monsters isn't a crime in itself...although I suppose that it does give a motive if Sithik was involved. On its own, it's not enough evidence though.
# Authored fix (not Wiki): a separator so each piece of evidence is its own branch.
3	action	-
3	cond	If the player has the dragon inn tankard:
4	box	You show the dragon Inn Tankard to Zavistic.
4	line	Player	This is the tankard I found on the remains of Brentle Vahn!
4	cond	If the player has shown Zavistic the Dragon Inn tankard before:
5	line	Zavistic Rarve	Yeah, you've shown me this before...if this is all the evidence you have?
5	line	Player	Please just look at it again...
5	line	Zavistic Rarve	Ok, let me look then.
4	line	Zavistic Rarve	That doesn't mean anything in itself, you could have gotten that from anywhere. Even from the Dragon Inn tavern! There isn't anything to link Brentle Vahn with Sithik Ints.
# Authored fix (not Wiki): a separator so each piece of evidence is its own branch.
3	action	-
3	cond	If the player has the signed portrait:
4	box	You show the signed portrait of Sithik to Zavistic.
4	line	Player	This is a portrait of Sithik, signed by the landlord of the Dragon Inn saying that he saw Sithik and Brentle Vahn together.
4	cond	If the player has shown Zavistic the signed portrait before:
5	line	Zavistic Rarve	Yeah, you've shown me this before...if this is all the evidence you have?
5	line	Player	Please just look at it again...
5	line	Zavistic Rarve	Ok, let me look then.
4	line	Zavistic Rarve	Hmmm, well that is interesting.
# Authored fix (not Wiki): separator, so the verdict below is evaluated after every item.
3	action	-
3	cond	If the player has not yet shown all 4 pieces of evidence:
4	line	Zavistic Rarve	However, there isn't enough evidence for me to take the issue further at this point. If you find any further evidence bring it to me.
4	action	end
3	cond	If the player has shown all 4 pieces of evidence:
4	line	Zavistic Rarve	And I'm starting to think that Sithik may be involved. Here, take this potion and give some to Sithik. It'll bring on a change which should solicit some answers - tell him the effects won't revert until he's told the truth.
4	box	Zavistic hands you a strange looking potion bottle and takes all the evidence you've accumulated so far.
4	action	end
